{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25475","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 自叙 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 自叙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五岳径虽深，遍游心已荡。\n苟能知止足，所遇皆清旷。\n七十难可期，一丘乃微尚。\n遥怀少室山，常恐非吾望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}